<title>USA: Omaha hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 higher. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA US  1-3    230-270 lbs    59.50-60.00</p>
<p>Sows: 25 percent. Steady to 1.00 higher. Top 49.00. US 1-3     350-450 lbs    45.50</p>
<p>	     450-500 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>US 2-3     500-650 lbs    48.00-49.00</p>
